WEBVTT

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.360
"Kodomo no Odocha"

00:00:11.530 --> 00:00:13.700
That rumor that I love you

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:17.330
is true, yes it is.

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:20.830
You can't ignore it either.

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:25.420
Whether you're awake or asleep,

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:29.050
please don't be embarrassed.

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:36.640
Is it a sin if I sneak into your heart

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:40.310
by ridding you...

00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:43.480
...of your other love?

00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:48.060
At sunset,

00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:50.570
when the children go home,

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:54.530
Today's incident is burning love!

00:00:54.650 --> 00:00:58.410
You can tell it accurately.

00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:00.490
7 O'Clock News!

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:04.290
Please, our relationship...

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:09.960
Please don't blame it on the true kiss

00:01:10.090 --> 00:01:11.750
In a city without light,

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:15.680
let's burn the fire of love.

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:19.100
Don't be so easy going

00:01:19.220 --> 00:01:21.350
The existence is a mistake

00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:24.850
You're asking for something not there.

00:01:32.150 --> 00:01:36.150
I'm Kurata Sana, a 6th grader
and TV personality.

00:01:36.150 --> 00:01:39.490
My beloved Mama is
an Aoki-award winning novelist.

00:01:39.490 --> 00:01:44.160
My former boyfriend, Sagami Rei-kun.
He's my chauffeur and manager.

00:01:44.160 --> 00:01:45.830
The mysterious white bat straight man.

00:01:45.830 --> 00:01:48.460
I'm Babbit. Boy or girl? Who knows?

00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:52.500
Hayama Akito, my natural enemy,
and good friend.

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:54.800
Father Hayama.
Father, the background is too dark.

00:01:54.840 --> 00:01:57.800
Sana-chan, come visit us again soon.

00:01:58.840 --> 00:02:02.390
"Heart of Karate and
Announcement of Retirement"

00:02:02.810 --> 00:02:06.480
Okay, Sana-chan,
if I win this hand, then...

00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:09.190
"For a tooth powder that gives you
a whiter smile, it's Hamigakin Z!"

00:02:09.190 --> 00:02:11.150
...will be your next commercial.

00:02:11.150 --> 00:02:14.190
Bring it on, Rei-kun. If I win...

00:02:14.190 --> 00:02:16.190
I get to have a barbecue out in
the yard with Aya-chan and the others,

00:02:16.190 --> 00:02:18.200
where we'll make lots of dango dumplings,
and look at the moon,

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:19.860
and then... and then... ...do this, that,
and anything else I want to do for

00:02:19.860 --> 00:02:21.160
the last half-year
of my grade-school life!

00:02:21.160 --> 00:02:24.160
...and until then,
don't talk to me about work again.

00:02:34.460 --> 00:02:37.300
Hm hm hm... This is
for the match, Rei-kun.

00:02:37.300 --> 00:02:38.800
Which one are you going to pick?

00:02:38.800 --> 00:02:41.050
I've got a one-in-two
chance of winning...

00:02:41.050 --> 00:02:44.140
but then, I have a one-in-two
chance of losing, too.

00:02:44.140 --> 00:02:46.140
Are you guys still at it?

00:02:46.140 --> 00:02:47.140
This is the last one.

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:51.310
"Sana!" "Rei-kun"

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:48.140
So, who's winning?

00:02:48.140 --> 00:02:51.810
Rei-kun is getting trounced!
His lousiness at this is something else!

00:02:51.810 --> 00:02:53.820
Just as I thought. Sagami-kun you're...

00:02:53.820 --> 00:02:56.150
What, Sensei?

00:02:56.150 --> 00:02:58.150
Sagami-kun, you really are... you know.

00:02:58.150 --> 00:03:00.490
Please, just come out and say it!

00:03:00.490 --> 00:03:05.490
How disturbing. I'm...
What is it you're saying I am!?

00:03:05.490 --> 00:03:08.160
I'm not telling!

00:03:08.160 --> 00:03:10.160
Whatever, just take one! Hurry, hurry!

00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:12.830
This is the white bat, Babbit, Babbit!
Come on, come on!

00:03:12.830 --> 00:03:14.500
Come on, pick one, pick one.

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:16.170
Come on, come on.

00:03:16.170 --> 00:03:18.630
I'm going to win! I'm going to win!
I'm going to win!

00:03:23.850 --> 00:03:25.180
I'm going to win... I'm going to win...
I'm going to win...

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:27.850
Okay, I'll take that one.
That's the game.

00:03:27.850 --> 00:03:29.930
Sagami-kun, you really are...

00:03:31.190 --> 00:03:38.440
Bye, now, Rei-kun.
No commercials for me...

00:03:38.440 --> 00:03:42.110
I'm just no good at critical times!

00:03:42.110 --> 00:03:43.870
Bingo!

00:04:04.800 --> 00:04:09.100
I think that the strength and sharpness
of your chop are suited toward karate.

00:04:13.140 --> 00:04:15.150
You rented a video?

00:04:15.150 --> 00:04:16.810
Y- yeah.

00:04:16.810 --> 00:04:19.150
This doesn't look like a weird video.

00:04:19.150 --> 00:04:20.150
How do you mean, weird?

00:04:20.150 --> 00:04:22.740
Oh, nothing.

00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:25.820
You're not going to watch any more?

00:04:25.820 --> 00:04:27.160
I've seen enough.

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:30.160
How have you been lately?

00:04:30.160 --> 00:04:33.120
Is school... interesting?

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:34.460
Not really.

00:04:34.460 --> 00:04:36.500
You don't say.

00:04:37.790 --> 00:04:39.750
The bathtub is available.

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:44.800
I have... a favor to ask.

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:46.470
What's that?

00:04:46.470 --> 00:04:49.180
I want to take karate.

00:04:52.480 --> 00:04:53.480
Fishing pole!

00:04:53.480 --> 00:04:54.810
Butterfly net!

00:04:54.810 --> 00:04:57.020
Inner tube! Swimsuit! Rubber raft!
Skateboard! Watercolors!

00:04:57.020 --> 00:04:59.480
After that... after that... okay!

00:04:59.480 --> 00:05:01.570
Now I'm going to
take back all the things

00:05:01.570 --> 00:05:03.820
that I was too busy to do
because of work, all at once!

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:06.160
You mean like your studies?

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:07.660
I'm going to have a barbecue
party with Aya-chan and the others!

00:05:07.660 --> 00:05:09.160
And a karaoke party, swimming party,
moon-viewing party!

00:05:09.160 --> 00:05:10.490
Party! Party! Party! Party!

00:05:10.490 --> 00:05:13.830
Lesson prep, review, homework party!

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:15.830
We'll do that again next time!

00:05:15.830 --> 00:05:18.840
You're saying you've
ever done it before?

00:05:18.840 --> 00:05:19.920
"Matsunami Dojo"

00:05:26.180 --> 00:05:27.220
Hey!

00:05:31.760 --> 00:05:34.560
It's starting to get numb here!
Here! Here!

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:41.110
I told you not to move.

00:05:41.110 --> 00:05:42.440
What?

00:05:42.440 --> 00:05:44.530
Nothing.

00:05:59.460 --> 00:06:01.460
Wipe, Hayama!

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:04.130
Wipe, I said!

00:06:04.130 --> 00:06:07.630
Wipe, Hayama! Don't mess with me!

00:06:09.140 --> 00:06:11.260
S- such a happy face you've got there...

00:06:14.470 --> 00:06:16.480
Hayama, huh?

00:06:16.480 --> 00:06:17.810
--Thank you very much!

00:06:17.810 --> 00:06:19.150
Okay!

00:06:19.150 --> 00:06:22.980
Yay! It's over! It's over!
Let's go play!

00:06:25.820 --> 00:06:29.160
What's the matter, Hayama?
Aren't you going home?

00:06:29.160 --> 00:06:32.410
This is a karate dojo, right?

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:35.450
If you're not going to teach karate,
then refund my tuition.

00:06:35.450 --> 00:06:37.460
Don't mess with me!

00:06:37.460 --> 00:06:40.420
Hayama! First off,
you need to watch your mouth!

00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:44.460
Listen, proper sitting and cleaning
are all part of the training.

00:06:44.460 --> 00:06:48.470
The most important thing,
to those who aspire to the martial arts--

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:51.430
Are you trying to lecture me?

00:06:51.430 --> 00:06:52.140
What?

00:06:52.140 --> 00:06:53.800
You can talk for the rest of your life.

00:06:53.800 --> 00:06:55.470
Just a moment!

00:06:55.470 --> 00:06:58.140
Why did you come here!?

00:06:58.140 --> 00:07:00.810
What do you want to learn?
Techniques to let you win fights?

00:07:00.810 --> 00:07:04.480
Or are you here because you're
fascinated with action movie stars?

00:07:04.480 --> 00:07:06.320
I...

00:07:09.150 --> 00:07:12.160
...want to... learn...

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:15.120
...what it is...

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:18.500
...what it is... that I want to do.

00:07:18.500 --> 00:07:20.120
I see.

00:07:21.170 --> 00:07:23.130
How does this sound?

00:07:22.920 --> 00:07:25.840
"Encouraging Information Corner"

00:07:23.830 --> 00:07:25.920
The serious stuff will be over soon.

00:07:26.170 --> 00:07:29.170
Do you know how Japanese karate
is faring against the rest of the world?

00:07:29.170 --> 00:07:30.840
Not really.

00:07:30.840 --> 00:07:35.100
The girls can hold their own,
but the boys are comparatively weak.

00:07:35.100 --> 00:07:37.430
You call that an
Encouraging Information Corner?

00:07:37.430 --> 00:07:38.770
What I'm saying is...

00:07:38.770 --> 00:07:42.270
...if you're going to pursue this,
now's the best time.

00:07:47.780 --> 00:07:49.990
♪ --Karaoke, whoa, whoa! ♪
--I'm no good...

00:07:49.990 --> 00:07:51.610
♪ --The barbecue-cue is lit, ♪
--I'm no good...

00:07:51.610 --> 00:07:52.450
♪ --and there's juice. ♪
--I'm no good...

00:07:52.450 --> 00:07:54.780
♪ --and there's juice. ♪
--One order of corncob!
--Okay, coming up!

00:07:54.780 --> 00:07:56.120
I'm no good...

00:07:56.120 --> 00:07:58.120
♪ --Let's sing, hey, hey! ♪
--I'm no good...

00:07:58.120 --> 00:08:01.460
♪ --Everything from start to finish, ♪
--One order of ribs!
--Okay, coming up!

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:03.790
♪ --the odds and ends! ♪
--I'm no good... I'm no good...

00:08:03.790 --> 00:08:05.790
♪ --the odds and ends!
--One order of bomb!
--Okay, coming up!

00:08:05.790 --> 00:08:09.130
By the way, Sana-chan,
did you hear about Hayama-kun?

00:08:09.130 --> 00:08:10.460
Hayama is taking karate!?

00:08:10.460 --> 00:08:11.800
Well, aren't you
putting your back into it?

00:08:11.800 --> 00:08:13.930
I heard from Tsuyoshi-kun

00:08:13.930 --> 00:08:17.810
that he's starting to go to
Principal Narunaru's friend's dojo.

00:08:17.810 --> 00:08:20.140
This is Narunaru.

00:08:20.140 --> 00:08:22.480
Come to mention it, I think
I heard something about that.

00:08:22.480 --> 00:08:26.150
I've been so busy lately that oops,
I must have just forgotten about it.

00:08:26.150 --> 00:08:28.650
I wonder if Hayama-kun is
thinking about taking karate,

00:08:28.650 --> 00:08:29.820
and then cutting loose at school again.

00:08:29.820 --> 00:08:33.070
--Seriously, give us a break, already.

00:08:33.070 --> 00:08:34.700
--Still, I don't think that's it.
--What? What are they talking about?

00:08:34.700 --> 00:08:37.740
--But it's surprising that Hayama
would be taking anything up, huh?
--No matter...

00:08:37.740 --> 00:08:41.000
I'm going to go watch his karate lesson
tomorrow with Tsuyoshi-kun.

00:08:41.000 --> 00:08:43.410
Sana-chan, want to go, too?

00:08:43.410 --> 00:08:46.750
I'm going! I'm going,
I'm going, you bet I'm going!

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:48.750
--Aya-chan, seems like you and Tsuyoshi
are getting along pretty well lately.
--Rei-kun, you okay?

00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:50.090
--Aya-chan, seems like you and Tsuyoshi
are getting along pretty well lately.
--I'm no good...

00:08:50.090 --> 00:08:54.430
--You really wanted to go alone
with Tsuyoshi-kun tomorrow, didn't you?
--I'm no good...

00:08:54.430 --> 00:08:56.430
--No, it's not like that.
--I'm no good...

00:08:56.430 --> 00:09:00.770
--Not like that! Not like that!
It's not like that!
--I'm no good...

00:09:00.770 --> 00:09:03.770
Take this, and this, and this, thief!

00:09:03.770 --> 00:09:05.770
I don't need this.

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:08.440
Sana-chan, remember,
there's a taping of "Child's Toy" today.

00:09:08.440 --> 00:09:10.780
Hey, hey, ho, I know.

00:09:10.780 --> 00:09:14.450
There's also this tasty drama I'd like
to talk to you for just a little bit,

00:09:14.450 --> 00:09:16.450
if you don't mind listening.

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:17.450
No thank you.

00:09:17.450 --> 00:09:20.790
--Well, just read these letters,
and listen to this tape.
--So listen, about work, there's this...

00:09:20.790 --> 00:09:23.450
I won at Old Maid, so I'm not
listening to anything about work.

00:09:23.450 --> 00:09:27.460
It really is a good job. Now that
you're in the public eye, Sana-chan,

00:09:27.460 --> 00:09:31.420
this is the perfect chance to line up
some good jobs, and make your big break!

00:09:31.420 --> 00:09:32.090
Rei-kun...

00:09:32.090 --> 00:09:33.090
Yes?

00:09:33.090 --> 00:09:36.340
Look the other way!

00:09:38.090 --> 00:09:41.100
And, while you're occupied with that,
it's composition time!

00:09:41.100 --> 00:09:46.100
♪ I'm... so... sor... ry... ♪

00:09:46.100 --> 00:09:48.730
Sana-chan, if you're
turning down work like this...

00:09:48.730 --> 00:09:50.110
don't tell me you're
thinking of quitting.

00:09:50.110 --> 00:09:51.770
♪ I'm so sorry, I'm so sorry,
please excuse me. ♪

00:09:51.770 --> 00:09:53.780
♪ --I'm so sorry, I'm so sorry,
please excuse me.  ♪
--She can't have gotten far.

00:09:53.780 --> 00:09:57.450
♪ --I feel consumed with guilt. ♪
--Sana-chan!

00:09:57.450 --> 00:10:01.120
♪ I apologize more than Niagara falls. ♪

00:10:01.120 --> 00:10:03.450
♪ Sorry, noodles,
forgive me, tea table. ♪

00:10:03.450 --> 00:10:06.660
Sorry, Rei-kun. I don't want to
think about something as difficult

00:10:06.660 --> 00:10:09.790
as whether I'm going to quit
or go on working right now.

00:10:09.790 --> 00:10:12.800
Sana-chan! Sana-chan!

00:10:12.800 --> 00:10:15.590
Here's this week's Sana-chan!

00:10:17.130 --> 00:10:20.850
She has been through a lot.
I'm sure she's just a little discouraged.

00:10:20.850 --> 00:10:22.810
Give her a little time off.

00:10:22.810 --> 00:10:24.140
Sensei...

00:10:24.140 --> 00:10:26.480
I pushed her into making
that promise with me,

00:10:26.480 --> 00:10:28.520
because I thought it would be an
effective way to have lots of people read

00:10:28.520 --> 00:10:30.810
"My Daughter and I."

00:10:30.810 --> 00:10:35.400
Sana, become a little more famous
than other children.

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:38.400
She lived up to what
I asked her to do perfectly.

00:10:38.400 --> 00:10:40.410
Now that she has fulfilled her promise,

00:10:40.410 --> 00:10:42.410
there's no reason to
force her to continue working.

00:10:42.410 --> 00:10:45.410
But I thought that
Sana-chan loves to perform.

00:10:45.410 --> 00:10:46.750
Yes, and as such...

00:10:46.750 --> 00:10:51.420
...let her decide whether she wants
to continue working, or to quit.

00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:52.750
Okay.

00:10:52.750 --> 00:10:56.420
If anything, the problem that arises
if Sana-chan decides to quit working...

00:10:56.420 --> 00:10:58.920
...is what will happen
to you from here on out.

00:10:59.760 --> 00:11:02.800
M- my life as a manager...!

00:11:06.770 --> 00:11:09.390
Akito-kun!

00:11:10.440 --> 00:11:13.440
We came to watch you.

00:11:13.440 --> 00:11:17.280
We invited Sana-chan to come, too,
so I think she'll be here later.

00:11:21.110 --> 00:11:23.780
I told you not to come watch me.

00:11:23.780 --> 00:11:26.450
Still, you're really making a go of it.

00:11:26.450 --> 00:11:28.250
I heard that Japanese girls
are good at karate,

00:11:28.250 --> 00:11:31.790
but the boys can't hold their own
against the rest of the world.

00:11:31.790 --> 00:11:33.790
What does that have to do with it?

00:11:33.790 --> 00:11:35.130
I'm making a go of it.

00:11:35.130 --> 00:11:37.460
The rest of the world...!?

00:11:38.800 --> 00:11:40.800
An undisciplined kid like you!?

00:11:40.800 --> 00:11:43.260
Isn't that what you want to say,
Tsuyoshi-kun?

00:11:45.470 --> 00:11:47.810
♪ Hooray, hooray, Hayama! ♪

00:11:47.810 --> 00:11:49.810
♪ Hayama, hooray! ♪

00:11:49.810 --> 00:11:51.810
Here comes another simpleton.

00:11:51.810 --> 00:11:53.810
♪ Chop! Chop! Chop! Hot stuff!
Karate chop! ♪

00:11:53.810 --> 00:11:55.810
♪ Hayama taking karate? Ho ho ho ho ho! ♪

00:11:55.810 --> 00:11:57.820
♪ Come on, come on, tough it out,
tough it out, Hayama! ♪

00:11:57.820 --> 00:11:59.820
♪ Sana-chan will tough it out,
tough it out, with you! ♪

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:01.820
♪ Cheering for you, toughing it out,
sticking it out, too! ♪

00:12:01.820 --> 00:12:04.160
♪ Holding it out, ballooning it out,
ballooning it out, slurping it out! ♪

00:12:04.160 --> 00:12:06.830
♪ Come on, come on, hang in there,
Hayama, boom! ♪

00:12:06.830 --> 00:12:10.500
Whatever. I'm a busy person here,
so see you later.

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:12.500
Hey, just a minute!

00:12:12.500 --> 00:12:14.420
And after I came to cheer you on!

00:12:14.420 --> 00:12:16.500
The person's weight dummy rushed here
to cheer you on, too!

00:12:16.500 --> 00:12:19.840
I don't need you to cheer me on.

00:12:19.840 --> 00:12:22.510
What kind of attitude is that!? Ka-blam!!

00:12:22.510 --> 00:12:25.180
Sana-chan, you're even worse than me.

00:12:25.180 --> 00:12:27.850
Be grateful!
Otherwise, I'm going to run riot!

00:12:27.850 --> 00:12:30.180
Okay, I already am running riot...!

00:12:30.180 --> 00:12:32.140
Sana-chan is doing karate, too.

00:12:32.140 --> 00:12:34.440
But she doesn't seem
to have it under control.

00:12:34.440 --> 00:12:37.820
Okay then, time for a commercial.

00:12:37.820 --> 00:12:39.860
Sana-chan...

00:12:41.780 --> 00:12:43.650
I'll peck you.

00:12:57.580 --> 00:13:01.590
I can't believe that
our Hayama-kun is cleaning.

00:13:01.590 --> 00:13:03.880
Still, isn't karate supposed to be...

00:13:03.920 --> 00:13:06.550
...more like this, or more like this,
or more like this!?

00:13:06.550 --> 00:13:09.930
This is karate! This is youth!

00:13:09.930 --> 00:13:14.180
They probably learn that
once they've had more training.

00:13:15.270 --> 00:13:17.270
We'll see how long
a show-off like Hayama

00:13:17.270 --> 00:13:18.940
can last in this kind
of restrained training.

00:13:18.940 --> 00:13:20.230
S- Sana-chan...

00:13:20.230 --> 00:13:21.860
If you ask me, being toughened up

00:13:21.860 --> 00:13:24.570
and trained hard In Gekidan Komawari
since I was 5,

00:13:24.570 --> 00:13:27.950
performing is a rigorous path to follow!

00:13:27.950 --> 00:13:29.990
Sana-chan is putting the path to performing

00:13:29.990 --> 00:13:31.620
and the path to martial arts
in the same category.

00:13:31.620 --> 00:13:34.540
It would just be too much trouble
to butt in, so let's keep quiet.

00:13:34.540 --> 00:13:36.870
Huh!? But I want to butt in!

00:13:36.870 --> 00:13:39.710
Hayama! Give it all you've got!

00:13:39.710 --> 00:13:43.010
I'm going to watch that
wretched determination of yours closely!

00:13:43.010 --> 00:13:44.210
This will be a treat!

00:13:44.210 --> 00:13:45.880
Hey, you guys!

00:13:45.880 --> 00:13:48.550
If you're going to observe,
then do it a little more quietly!

00:13:48.550 --> 00:13:49.890
--S- sorry.

00:13:49.890 --> 00:13:51.890
Okay, quietly.

00:13:51.890 --> 00:13:55.230
Hayama, quietly do your best...!
Do your best nice and low...!

00:13:55.230 --> 00:13:57.230
If you turn up your volume,
you can hear her.

00:13:57.230 --> 00:14:01.650
Call up your tiny little determination,
and go, go, with this timid karate...!

00:14:02.900 --> 00:14:07.610
Rei-kun, you would choose
this time to press your Burutcha!

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:11.240
Hey! You guys, go home already!

00:14:11.240 --> 00:14:13.580
--Excuse us!

00:14:13.580 --> 00:14:16.580
I told you, there's a taping
of "Child's Toy" today!

00:14:16.580 --> 00:14:20.580
Maybe I should quit "Child's Toy."

00:14:20.580 --> 00:14:23.250
You shouldn't joke about
something like that so casually.

00:14:23.250 --> 00:14:24.760
If I didn't have all this work,

00:14:24.760 --> 00:14:27.590
I could have played more with
Aya-chan and the others. That's right!

00:14:27.590 --> 00:14:30.010
That's right! I hate work! I hate it!
I hate it! A hundred times, I hate it!

00:14:30.010 --> 00:14:30.930
A thousand times, I hate it!

00:14:30.930 --> 00:14:33.010
--10,000 times, I hate it! A million times,
I hate it! A hundred million times,
--What's wrong?

00:14:33.010 --> 00:14:34.180
--I hate it! I hate it! I hate it!
--Why are you saying
such a childish thing?

00:14:34.180 --> 00:14:36.140
Well, well, I am a child!
I appear on "Child's Toy"

00:14:36.140 --> 00:14:40.520
because I am a child, you know!
I'm in grade school! I'm a child!

00:14:40.520 --> 00:14:43.190
All right, all right, you can quiet down.

00:14:46.190 --> 00:14:48.530
Aah! A baby!?

00:14:48.530 --> 00:14:50.200
Goo-goo gah-gah, goo-goo gah-gah...

00:14:50.200 --> 00:14:52.870
S- Sana-chan, get hold of yourself!
Sana-chan!

00:14:52.870 --> 00:14:55.870
"Telegraph game"

00:14:52.870 --> 00:14:53.870
I heard that Sana-chan...

00:14:53.870 --> 00:14:54.870
...is having problems.

00:14:54.870 --> 00:14:55.870
She's feeling reluctant.

00:14:55.870 --> 00:14:56.540
Heard she's gonna quit.

00:14:56.540 --> 00:14:58.210
Heard she's gonna retire.

00:14:58.210 --> 00:15:01.040
Okay, let's bang out anothuh
"Child's Toy" today!

00:15:01.040 --> 00:15:04.550
With Sana-chan around,
we can rest easy about the ratings!

00:15:04.550 --> 00:15:06.800
Sana-chan's gonna retire!?

00:15:10.550 --> 00:15:12.220
"Zenjiro's Child's Toy"

00:15:14.220 --> 00:15:16.140
Sana-chan, what's the mattuh?

00:15:16.140 --> 00:15:17.890
If somethings troubling you,
tell your big brothuh here.

00:15:17.890 --> 00:15:20.890
We awl go through hawd times.
We awl get sad.

00:15:20.890 --> 00:15:24.230
That's life. Everyone gets through it
and goes on to live happily.

00:15:24.230 --> 00:15:26.610
Is somebody bullying you!?
If they are,

00:15:26.610 --> 00:15:28.900
then your big brothuh will teach
them a lesson! Like this, and this!

00:15:28.900 --> 00:15:30.900
And this, and this, and this!

00:15:30.900 --> 00:15:33.950
I'm not having a hard time goo-goo.
I'm not sad about anything either, goo-goo.

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:35.530
Life is lots of fun goo-goo.

00:15:35.530 --> 00:15:38.200
Is that right? Well then, why are you--?

00:15:38.200 --> 00:15:42.210
H- hold on! Cut that out! Sana-chan!
You dummy! Aah! You're on my--!

00:15:42.210 --> 00:15:47.210
Sana-chan, this is my fault.
I was wrong.

00:15:47.210 --> 00:15:51.550
I didn't realize I'd been pushing you
so hard up to now. I'm sorry, Sana-chan.

00:15:51.550 --> 00:15:53.840
"Meanwhile, at the Hayama's house..."

00:15:53.220 --> 00:15:53.890
Yum!

00:15:53.890 --> 00:15:57.890
Akito, are you liking the karate dojo?

00:15:57.890 --> 00:15:59.680
Yes.

00:16:02.560 --> 00:16:04.560
D- did you just say "Yes"!?

00:16:04.560 --> 00:16:07.900
--Hey, you just said "Yes," didn't you!?
--I'm still not doing anything
but the basic exercises.

00:16:07.900 --> 00:16:11.570
Is that right? Be careful
not to get yourself hurt.

00:16:11.570 --> 00:16:14.320
Right. Compliments to the chef.

00:16:15.910 --> 00:16:19.580
H- hold on! You said "Yes"! What gives!?
What has come over you, Akito!?

00:16:19.580 --> 00:16:21.370
Akito said "compliments
to the chef"?! Aah!

00:16:21.370 --> 00:16:22.920
And he even took care
of his dirty dishes!

00:16:22.920 --> 00:16:24.250
Father, what in the world...!?

00:16:24.250 --> 00:16:25.920
He must have grown up a little.

00:16:25.920 --> 00:16:28.250
Father, aren't you stunned!?

00:16:28.250 --> 00:16:29.590
Mm-hmm...

00:16:29.590 --> 00:16:31.260
"Yikes!"

00:16:29.590 --> 00:16:31.260
I'm terribly surprised.

00:16:35.180 --> 00:16:37.760
I take full responsibility for this,
and will deal with it,

00:16:37.800 --> 00:16:38.850
so you needn't worry.

00:16:38.850 --> 00:16:40.180
I'm counting on you.

00:16:40.180 --> 00:16:42.140
I will speak about what's going on
to the producers of "Child's Toy."

00:16:42.140 --> 00:16:45.190
I will make it so that
Sana-chan can spread her wings

00:16:45.190 --> 00:16:47.860
and live the normal
life of a grade-schooler" or rather,

00:16:47.860 --> 00:16:52.860
make up for what she had
to put up with, as much as she likes.

00:16:52.860 --> 00:16:56.870
Sana-chan! I will be on
your side in all things!

00:16:56.870 --> 00:16:59.870
By the way, do you have any prospects
for your next place of employment?

00:16:59.870 --> 00:17:00.870
Sensei...

00:17:00.870 --> 00:17:02.200
Yes?

00:17:02.200 --> 00:17:07.210
Sana-chan is more important to me
than just a manager-talent relationship.

00:17:07.210 --> 00:17:10.550
I am in her debt for
rescuing me when I was homeless.

00:17:10.550 --> 00:17:14.880
And so, even if Sana-chan leaves
show business, for her sake...

00:17:14.880 --> 00:17:16.550
I'll be in charge of her shoes...

00:17:16.550 --> 00:17:18.550
Here, I've warmed them up for you.

00:17:18.550 --> 00:17:19.890
Thank you!

00:17:19.890 --> 00:17:22.220
Ah, they're so warm!

00:17:22.220 --> 00:17:23.890
But it's summer right now!

00:17:23.890 --> 00:17:25.730
I'd take a bullet for her...

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:31.230
Rei-kun!

00:17:31.230 --> 00:17:34.150
That's what I'm prepared to do!
So please, Sensei...!

00:17:34.440 --> 00:17:36.700
"Gone to bed"

00:17:34.820 --> 00:17:36.820
You go on ahead with that.

00:17:36.820 --> 00:17:39.490
A- am I going to be able
to stay in this house?

00:17:39.490 --> 00:17:40.870
Keep trying.

00:17:40.870 --> 00:17:45.210
If I quit, then I won't have to think
about what work I have tomorrow.

00:17:45.210 --> 00:17:47.540
I won't have to put up with
turning down playing with everyone,

00:17:47.540 --> 00:17:50.210
or hide my nervousness
about being among all adults,

00:17:50.210 --> 00:17:53.880
or having to smile,
even when I'm tired and sleepy.

00:17:53.880 --> 00:17:57.220
Tomorrow's schedule is wide open!

00:17:57.220 --> 00:17:59.260
Don't make so much noise
in the middle of the night!

00:18:06.850 --> 00:18:07.850
Yow!!

00:18:07.890 --> 00:18:08.520
What's wrong!?

00:18:08.520 --> 00:18:11.230
What!? What!? What's wrong!?

00:18:11.230 --> 00:18:14.150
N- nothing...

00:18:16.240 --> 00:18:20.910
We will be landing shortly at
JFK New York International Airport.

00:18:20.910 --> 00:18:22.580
Sana-chan is retiring!?

00:18:22.580 --> 00:18:23.910
That's the rumor.

00:18:23.910 --> 00:18:26.160
I heard she's been turning down dramas
and commercials one after another,

00:18:26.160 --> 00:18:27.250
and is even quitting "Child's Toy."

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:29.920
T- take this plane
back to Japan, right now!

00:18:29.920 --> 00:18:32.500
Oh, you couldn't ask us to do that...

00:18:32.500 --> 00:18:35.510
Calm down! We have to finish
this location shoot in New York, first.

00:18:35.510 --> 00:18:35.840
Hey!

00:18:35.840 --> 00:18:38.720
I'm going back,
even if I have to jump out!

00:18:40.180 --> 00:18:41.510
Rats...

00:18:41.510 --> 00:18:44.850
Please don't do anything foolish--

00:18:44.850 --> 00:18:46.520
Give me a parachute! I'm getting out!

00:18:46.520 --> 00:18:47.520
Stop that, you idiot!

00:18:47.520 --> 00:18:48.520
Please stop!

00:18:48.520 --> 00:18:49.850
Stop!

00:18:49.850 --> 00:18:51.860
Hayama, what happened to your hand?

00:18:51.860 --> 00:18:52.860
I fell down.

00:18:52.860 --> 00:18:55.190
Is that right? Be careful.

00:18:55.190 --> 00:18:57.190
He's lying! Him! Him!

00:18:57.190 --> 00:19:01.160
All right, today I'll teach you the most
basic of the basics, the forward punch.

00:19:01.160 --> 00:19:02.660
Everyone stand up.

00:19:04.200 --> 00:19:06.790
I can't move. My legs are numb.

00:19:07.870 --> 00:19:10.790
Listen up. You ease your body
into it like this,

00:19:10.790 --> 00:19:12.880
keeping your head directly
above your hind end.

00:19:12.880 --> 00:19:16.880
Keep your arm at your side,
make a tight fist, and twist as you...

00:19:16.880 --> 00:19:17.880
strike!

00:19:22.220 --> 00:19:23.550
Where are you going, Sana-chan!?

00:19:23.550 --> 00:19:24.220
For a walk!

00:19:24.220 --> 00:19:25.890
I- I'd like to go, too!

00:19:25.890 --> 00:19:27.220
Come home soon!

00:19:27.220 --> 00:19:29.230
No, I mean together with you, Sana-chan!

00:19:29.230 --> 00:19:31.560
Go the other way!

00:19:33.150 --> 00:19:35.820
Could she be avoiding me?

00:19:35.820 --> 00:19:39.150
So close, yet so far. Bingo!

00:19:39.150 --> 00:19:42.160
Clouds! Sky!

00:19:42.160 --> 00:19:44.830
Nature! Freedom!

00:19:44.830 --> 00:19:49.290
From now on, this freedom
is going to continue on and on.

00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:55.000
Hayama...

00:19:58.170 --> 00:20:02.840
Yo, Hayama! Are you pretending
to be in training, or something?

00:20:05.510 --> 00:20:07.510
G- get out of the way!

00:20:07.510 --> 00:20:10.850
What are you talking about,
slugging me out of nowhere?

00:20:10.850 --> 00:20:12.440
Sorry about that.

00:20:13.850 --> 00:20:14.860
Retiring?

00:20:14.860 --> 00:20:16.190
What do you think?

00:20:16.190 --> 00:20:17.520
Seems all right to me.

00:20:17.520 --> 00:20:20.190
You think so, really?

00:20:20.190 --> 00:20:22.070
If that's what you want to do.

00:20:25.200 --> 00:20:29.870
Say, why did you suddenly
start taking karate?

00:20:29.870 --> 00:20:32.210
Because of Principal Narunaru.

00:20:32.210 --> 00:20:37.210
It's not like you to act on other
people's suggestions. So why...?

00:20:37.500 --> 00:20:39.210
That day...

00:20:40.170 --> 00:20:42.510
...when we went to see your play...

00:20:42.510 --> 00:20:43.840
My play?

00:20:43.840 --> 00:20:47.640
That's when I... I wanted
to start doing something, too.

00:20:48.850 --> 00:20:50.520
Later.

00:20:50.520 --> 00:20:51.850
Hayama...

00:20:51.850 --> 00:20:55.190
He wanted to do something...?

00:20:55.190 --> 00:20:57.520
He wanted something to do...?

00:20:57.520 --> 00:21:01.530
Up to now, I never
thought of it that way.

00:21:01.530 --> 00:21:06.530
Hayama, if you want to do karate,
then I... I want to...

00:21:08.200 --> 00:21:10.870
That was the first taping of
"Child's Toy" that Sana-chan was at.

00:21:10.870 --> 00:21:14.210
That was on location...
a- and that... that...

00:21:14.210 --> 00:21:16.540
Please don't cry.

00:21:16.540 --> 00:21:18.540
You're going to make me sad, too.

00:21:18.540 --> 00:21:20.550
Should we cry, too?

00:21:20.550 --> 00:21:22.880
Yes, let's cry.

00:21:22.880 --> 00:21:23.880
I'm home!

00:21:23.880 --> 00:21:24.880
Sana-chan!

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:26.550
Huh? You guys are all here?

00:21:26.550 --> 00:21:29.220
Sana-chan, have you retired
from the entertainment world?

00:21:29.220 --> 00:21:32.560
That's such a shame!
Everyone will be disappointed!

00:21:32.560 --> 00:21:35.230
Well, if everyone says so...

00:21:35.230 --> 00:21:38.230
Mm-hmm! I'm quitting quitting!

00:21:38.230 --> 00:21:40.230
You mean it, Sana-chan!?

00:21:40.230 --> 00:21:42.900
Yeah, well, while I was out walking around,
I changed my mind all the way around,

00:21:42.900 --> 00:21:44.900
so here I am again.

00:21:44.900 --> 00:21:48.240
Let's do some good work together again,
Rei-kun, one at a time.

00:21:48.240 --> 00:21:49.240
--Sana-chan...

00:21:49.240 --> 00:21:54.250
Now then, as long as everyone is here,
let's have a bang-up celebration!

00:21:54.250 --> 00:21:56.670
Hey! Who is that, making so much noise
in someone else's yard

00:21:56.670 --> 00:21:59.000
this early in the evening!? Oh, it's you!

00:21:59.920 --> 00:22:01.250
Naozumi-kun!

00:22:01.250 --> 00:22:04.590
Sana-chan, you can't retire!

00:22:04.590 --> 00:22:07.840
Quit it! Quit it! I'm not quitting,
so quit it!

00:22:08.430 --> 00:22:10.180
You ease your body into it,

00:22:10.180 --> 00:22:12.100
keeping your head directly
above your hind end.

00:22:12.100 --> 00:22:15.770
Keep your arm at your side,
make a tight fist, and twist as you...

00:22:15.770 --> 00:22:18.440
Strike! Strike! Strike!

00:22:26.110 --> 00:22:30.280
They're right. Quitting something you
like for the sake of something you like--

00:22:30.280 --> 00:22:31.780
that's positively weird, huh?

00:22:31.780 --> 00:22:34.450
All right, I'll do this!

00:22:34.450 --> 00:22:39.370
I'm going to play, and work,
and everything else I want to do!

00:22:40.710 --> 00:22:42.210
"Back against the wall."

00:22:42.710 --> 00:22:47.720
That's what you say about times like these.

00:22:48.970 --> 00:22:52.470
In dire straits,

00:22:53.220 --> 00:22:56.060
I've been waiting for an answer.

00:22:56.560 --> 00:22:59.940
My confessions are worked out
long in advance,

00:23:00.900 --> 00:23:05.030
to always go along with the scenario.

00:23:05.230 --> 00:23:11.070
My heart may be settled, but my mind is in a...

00:23:11.320 --> 00:23:13.280
...panic!!

00:23:14.330 --> 00:23:19.160
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:19.330 --> 00:23:21.790
he's there.

00:23:22.710 --> 00:23:25.090
And our usual classroom...

00:23:25.300 --> 00:23:27.670
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:23:27.760 --> 00:23:30.180
...for two.

00:23:31.010 --> 00:23:33.640
Although I've said nothing but wisecracks...

00:23:33.850 --> 00:23:38.390
...up to now, just for today,

00:23:39.310 --> 00:23:41.980
I'm going to be honest and sincere,

00:23:42.190 --> 00:23:46.690
so BOY, take a look my way!

00:23:47.610 --> 00:23:52.280
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:52.450 --> 00:23:54.950
he's there,

00:23:55.910 --> 00:23:58.120
And our usual classroom...

00:23:58.370 --> 00:24:00.710
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:24:00.830 --> 00:24:03.210
...for two.

00:24:07.210 --> 00:24:09.920
Hoy! In Sana-chan's next adventures...

00:24:09.920 --> 00:24:14.140
Okay, I'm going to engage in both a
grade-schooler's life and in show business!

00:24:14.140 --> 00:24:15.800
Huh!? Mariko-chan!

00:24:15.800 --> 00:24:18.140
Oh, my younger sister Mariko-chan
has gone missing!

00:24:18.140 --> 00:24:20.430
What's more, it's because of
something I said offhandedly!?

00:24:20.430 --> 00:24:22.060
Oh, what a fix, what a fix!

00:24:22.060 --> 00:24:25.730
Huh? Zenjiro-san took Mariko-chan away!?
What's going on!?

00:24:25.730 --> 00:24:30.030
Next time, on "Kodomo no Omocha,"
episode 23, the Adventures of
Zenjiro-san and Mariko-chan Saga,

00:24:30.030 --> 00:24:33.780
Clear, With Occasional Gone Missing

00:24:33.780 --> 00:24:35.660
Zenjiro, I'm disappointed in you!
